<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Sometimes we lean only on ourselves,</l><l>Thinking we can do things without asking for Your help,</l><l>But Your Spirit in our spirit’s</l><l>Working in and breaking through</l><l>To free us from the “self” and back to You.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
